1
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:35,070
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,640
[Episode 18]

3
00:01:38,509 --> 00:01:40,350
Hey, Qi Aihua, you...

4
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,310
You and our daughter

5
00:01:42,310 --> 00:01:43,640
have been in cahoots,

6
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,200
plotting this

7
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,039
and doing whatever you want
behind my back.

8
00:01:46,039 --> 00:01:47,440
Don't even try to stop me.

9
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:48,560
Honey,

10
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:49,950
this is impressive.

11
00:01:49,950 --> 00:01:51,009
Your vocabulary is

12
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:51,970
really shining through

13
00:01:51,970 --> 00:01:53,100
at a time like this.

14
00:01:57,789 --> 00:01:58,789
Honey, honey...

15
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:00,150
Don't go.

16
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,950
It's already dark outside.

17
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:03,230
If you really want to go,
how about tomorrow?

18
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,150
I'll go with you tomorrow.

19
00:02:04,150 --> 00:02:04,560
Good?

20
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:06,410
So you know it's dark, too.

21
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:09,000
She's out there running a stall.

22
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,400
What if she gets bullied?

23
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:11,540
She's carrying all those bags

24
00:02:11,540 --> 00:02:13,080
of clothes in and out by herself.

25
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,740
What if it gets windy or rains?

26
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,590
If it's windy, she'll take shelter.

27
00:02:16,590 --> 00:02:18,590
If it rains, she'll use an umbrella.

28
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,400
Honey, come here.

29
00:02:29,470 --> 00:02:30,190
When I first saw

30
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:31,470
our daughter there,

31
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:34,140
I felt the same way you did.

32
00:02:34,910 --> 00:02:36,520
I wanted to rush over

33
00:02:37,190 --> 00:02:38,650
and build her a safe haven,

34
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,710
where she could be sheltered
from the whole world.

35
00:02:42,710 --> 00:02:43,680
But later, I saw

36
00:02:45,710 --> 00:02:46,710
our daughter

37
00:02:47,630 --> 00:02:48,400
bargaining

38
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,310
with the customers

39
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,030
and chatting nonstop with the stall owner

40
00:02:53,030 --> 00:02:54,240
next to her.

41
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,579
She kept giggling.

42
00:02:57,710 --> 00:02:59,000
I think she was happy.

43
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,400
Why did she feel happy?

44
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,600
Why was she giggling?

45
00:03:05,470 --> 00:03:06,030
All because

46
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:07,160
she proved herself.

47
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,800
She made it through

48
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,800
on her own.

49
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:13,870
So,

50
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,760
honey, don't worry.

51
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,090
Our daughter is doing fine.

52
00:03:24,590 --> 00:03:25,310
Tomorrow,

53
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,530
we'll go.

54
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:28,800
We'll go

55
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,600
tomorrow.

56
00:03:36,710 --> 00:03:38,040
Don't worry. It's fine.

57
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,650
My mom was here, too?

58
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:11,870
No way.

59
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,600
This girl is

60
00:04:40,870 --> 00:04:42,159
pretty quick-witted.

61
00:04:43,070 --> 00:04:44,190
You two have

62
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,260
some telepathic connection.

63
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,750
Let's follow her and take a look.

64
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:01,680
Zhang,

65
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,290
look, I pay on the spot every time.

66
00:05:03,290 --> 00:05:04,470
So can you give me 2 yuan off?

67
00:05:04,470 --> 00:05:05,240
No way.

68
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,750
I work my socks off for money.

69
00:05:06,750 --> 00:05:07,840
I want not a penny less.

70
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:08,870
I'm just a little vendor.

71
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:10,240
I work hard for every penny, too!

72
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:12,070
I work from dawn to dusk every day.

73
00:05:12,070 --> 00:05:13,680
How about this? Two yuan off twenty,

74
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,120
so eighteen.

75
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,360
Here's exactly eighteen yuan.

76
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,190
Take it.
I'll come to you for future business.

77
00:05:17,190 --> 00:05:18,920
Even family settles accounts clearly.

78
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,560
Were it not for my help,

79
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,360
you little vendor would

80
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,510
have to go to the market for goods.

81
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:22,770
Don't be unreasonable

82
00:05:23,190 --> 00:05:24,070
over two yuan.

83
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,190
Calm down.

84
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,260
Our daughter takes after you.

85
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,600
Rest assured,
she knows how to stand up for herself.

86
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,040
Fine,

87
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,980
I'll unload it myself.

88
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,450
Let me unload it myself.

89
00:05:42,230 --> 00:05:43,290
Alright, alright.

90
00:05:43,310 --> 00:05:44,000
You win.

91
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,510
You always push yourself

92
00:05:46,510 --> 00:05:47,430
just to save 2 bucks.

93
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,090
Be careful.

94
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:48,690
Here.

95
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,970
Thanks, bro.

96
00:05:53,010 --> 00:05:53,600
Be careful.

97
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,260
Let me do it.

98
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,870
It's fine.

99
00:06:02,430 --> 00:06:03,480
It's so hot outside.

100
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,880
Let me treat you to a soda.

101
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:09,240
Bro...

102
00:06:09,650 --> 00:06:10,950
This soda costs 2.50 yuan.

103
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:12,000
And you were just arguing with me

104
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,950
over two bucks...

105
00:06:12,950 --> 00:06:14,800
I really don't have any change.

106
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:16,680
These are two different things.

107
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,190
Call me next time you have work.

108
00:06:18,190 --> 00:06:19,800
I'll get it all sorted out for you.

109
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,270
Okay.

110
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,390
See? What did I tell you?

111
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,420
Just rest assured.

112
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:26,530
Our daughter is very capable.

113
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:27,750
And she has made

114
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:29,080
many friends out there.

115
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,290
Even without us,

116
00:06:30,870 --> 00:06:32,530
she'll do just fine on her own.

117
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,830
I'm off. I'll come to you next time.

118
00:06:34,830 --> 00:06:35,430
Take care.

119
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:42,240
Shall we go home?

120
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,830
What else shall we do?

121
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:45,890
Close the shop and stop making money?

122
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:49,060
Good thing I bought round-trip tickets.

123
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,040
Qi Shi,

124
00:07:05,870 --> 00:07:07,190
you didn't answer my calls

125
00:07:07,190 --> 00:07:07,870
or see me.

126
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,830
Is it because you think

127
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:11,560
you're not doing as well as I am,

128
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:13,010
that you've lost to me,

129
00:07:13,390 --> 00:07:15,520
and that you can never catch up with me?

130
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:46,680
Qi Shi.

131
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,590
Pack your things

132
00:07:48,590 --> 00:07:49,520
and come with me.

133
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,680
Come on.

134
00:07:58,850 --> 00:07:59,409
Hurry up.

135
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:15,430
Qi Shi!

136
00:08:16,630 --> 00:08:17,090
Hold on.

137
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,400
Here's the money for the clothes

138
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:26,010
from the blind date

139
00:08:26,750 --> 00:08:27,480
last time.

140
00:08:28,270 --> 00:08:29,510
I didn't catch you and didn't have

141
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:30,910
a chance to give it to you.

142
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,030
It was a gift for you.

143
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:35,360
I can't take this money.

144
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:37,440
Just take what I offer.

145
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,789
We have rules

146
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,750
that we can't accept your gifts.

147
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:41,549
If you don't take this money,

148
00:08:41,549 --> 00:08:42,870
I'll face disciplinary action.

149
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:43,320
What?

150
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,730
You want me to get punished?

151
00:08:45,870 --> 00:08:46,330
Take it.

152
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,090
Just take it.

153
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,360
You're so young

154
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,650
and quite smart.

155
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:00,440
What on earth is on your mind?

156
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,040
Do you plan

157
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:01,910
to play "guerrilla"

158
00:09:01,910 --> 00:09:02,670
with me forever?

159
00:09:02,670 --> 00:09:04,730
Like a hide-and-seek game every day?

160
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,140
In my point of view,

161
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:07,610
you need a long-term goal.

162
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:10,390
Well,

163
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,790
the night market street will

164
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:14,630
soon be open for stalls
in the day as well.

165
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,000
You

166
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,600
should get a proper license.

167
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:17,870
Zhiyuan!

168
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,580
My girlfriend.

169
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,570
She's picking me up from work.

170
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,550
Weren't you just on a blind date?

171
00:09:26,550 --> 00:09:27,960
You got a girlfriend so fast?

172
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,890
What do you mean?

173
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,120
Can't a blind date

174
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,360
just work out?

175
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,840
All thanks to you.

176
00:10:41,510 --> 00:10:42,370
You should know

177
00:10:43,170 --> 00:10:43,960
that neither of us

178
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,360
has ever been

179
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:47,200
the other's only rival.

180
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:50,370
Without me being your competitor,

181
00:10:50,750 --> 00:10:52,910
would you just give up
on stepping up your game

182
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:54,320
to be a better person?

183
00:10:55,550 --> 00:10:56,550
No, you wouldn't,

184
00:10:56,910 --> 00:10:58,040
and neither would I.

185
00:10:58,550 --> 00:10:59,720
I hope that one day

186
00:11:00,270 --> 00:11:01,800
we'll face each other again

187
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,820
as better versions of ourselves.

188
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,030
So cheesy.

189
00:11:13,330 --> 00:11:14,330
Hello, Qi Shi.

190
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,150
Several guys in our team

191
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:16,750
took a liking

192
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:18,550
to the clothes you picked for me.

193
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,650
They all said you've got good taste

194
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:23,000
and wanted you
to get a few pieces for them.

195
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,000
They've already given me the money.

196
00:11:26,530 --> 00:11:28,280
It's a good few hundred bucks.

197
00:11:29,550 --> 00:11:30,550
Thanks, bro.

198
00:11:31,110 --> 00:11:32,670
I'll pack the clothes tomorrow

199
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:35,470
and deliver them to you
first thing in the morning.

200
00:11:36,550 --> 00:11:37,630
Happy now?

201
00:11:37,900 --> 00:11:39,700
You made back today's fine.

202
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:40,670
However,

203
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:43,840
you still have to run your stall legally
from now on.

204
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,100
Don't play any tricks.

205
00:12:24,150 --> 00:12:25,080
I only hope that

206
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:27,600
when you're striving forward,

207
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,780
you can leave the past behind,

208
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,790
and when you stop to rest,

209
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:34,080
your friends can come to your mind.

210
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:37,180
My life is getting better and better.

211
00:12:37,510 --> 00:12:40,240
I don't have time
for your sentimental nonsense.

212
00:12:41,330 --> 00:12:46,270
[School of Continuing Education,
Haicheng University—Admissions Event]

213
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:43,130
Thank you, sir.

214
00:12:44,310 --> 00:12:44,740
Hello,

215
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,080
here is our enrollment brochure.

216
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:46,740
Take a look.

217
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,320
Sir, how much is it?

218
00:12:48,790 --> 00:12:50,120
The fees are on the back.

219
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:50,510
Here.

220
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,270
I need to think about it.

221
00:12:58,270 --> 00:12:58,670
Okay,

222
00:12:58,770 --> 00:12:59,740
take your time.

223
00:13:23,190 --> 00:13:25,770
♪ Countless times I broke the rules ♪

224
00:13:26,810 --> 00:13:30,560
♪ Countless times I longed to break free ♪

225
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:33,300
♪ I loudly laughed, mocked,
expressed anger, and yelled ♪

226
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:39,050
♪ Then I realized I missed you dearly ♪

227
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:43,200
♪ Countless times I searched for answers ♪

228
00:13:44,110 --> 00:13:47,510
♪ Would I be better off
if I lived a different life ♪

229
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:50,280
♪ But it turns out living in one's prime ♪

230
00:13:51,420 --> 00:13:53,350
♪ Just means ♪

231
00:13:53,630 --> 00:14:00,750
♪ That we can set out together ♪

232
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:04,520
♪ An old sofa ♪

233
00:14:06,670 --> 00:14:09,630
♪ A group photo
and several pots of flowers ♪

234
00:14:10,550 --> 00:14:12,580
♪ A few words of everyday talk ♪

235
00:14:13,170 --> 00:14:17,810
♪ I wish time could stop right now ♪

236
00:14:19,510 --> 00:14:22,450
♪ The revolving winters and summers ♪

237
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:25,350
[Qi's General Store]

238
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:26,480
♪ I grew up in the midst of chaos ♪

239
00:14:28,090 --> 00:14:30,070
♪ The world is full of changes ♪

240
00:14:30,610 --> 00:14:37,160
♪ With the door closed,
I'm back to the old days ♪

241
00:14:37,370 --> 00:14:40,760
♪ Countless times I broke the rules ♪

242
00:14:41,220 --> 00:14:44,980
♪ Countless times I longed to break free ♪

243
00:14:45,650 --> 00:14:48,000
♪ I loudly laughed, mocked,
expressed anger, and yelled ♪

244
00:14:48,170 --> 00:14:53,470
♪ Then I realized I missed you dearly ♪

245
00:14:51,230 --> 00:14:53,710
[Qi's Lifestyle Supermarket]

246
00:14:54,830 --> 00:14:57,610
♪ Countless times I searched for answers ♪

247
00:14:58,520 --> 00:15:01,920
♪ Would I be better off
if I lived a different life ♪

248
00:15:01,630 --> 00:15:02,270
Take

249
00:15:02,270 --> 00:15:03,600
the Zhangs' goods upstairs for them.

250
00:15:02,630 --> 00:15:04,690
♪ But it turns out living in one's prime ♪

251
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:04,620
Be careful.

252
00:15:05,830 --> 00:15:07,760
♪ Just means ♪

253
00:15:08,040 --> 00:15:15,160
♪ That we can set out together ♪

254
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:22,750
Happy?

255
00:15:22,750 --> 00:15:24,080
How is it? Are you happy?

256
00:15:25,630 --> 00:15:26,090
Come on.

257
00:15:26,630 --> 00:15:27,480
Let Daddy hold you.

258
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,680
Be careful, careful.

259
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:35,450
[Three years later]

260
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,200
See you.

261
00:16:17,910 --> 00:16:18,390
Boss!

262
00:16:19,030 --> 00:16:20,410
A bowl of noodles with beef, please!

263
00:16:20,410 --> 00:16:21,080
Coming right up.

264
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,340
My son, Zihao, just craves your noodles.

265
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:41,840
Cao took early retirement.
Did you know that?

266
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,500
I've heard.

267
00:16:43,630 --> 00:16:45,860
Why did he do that

268
00:16:45,910 --> 00:16:47,120
at his age?

269
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,910
He could have just waited
two more years to retire normally.

270
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:50,770
I've heard that

271
00:16:50,910 --> 00:16:52,110
early retirement now

272
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:53,720
isn't much better

273
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:55,210
than when we were laid off.

274
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,200
The pay

275
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,320
will be way lower.

276
00:16:57,630 --> 00:16:58,600
So what?

277
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:00,750
Right?

278
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:03,080
A real man

279
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,750
can overcome any obstacle.

280
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:05,680
Keep it down.

281
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:07,240
Look at me now.

282
00:17:08,030 --> 00:17:09,690
I'm doing pretty well, right?

283
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,750
You know what?

284
00:17:11,270 --> 00:17:12,400
If I were still working at the mine,

285
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:14,270
I wouldn't be living such a good life.

286
00:17:14,270 --> 00:17:15,680
You just got lucky.

287
00:17:16,790 --> 00:17:17,750
A fluke.

288
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:19,480
A fluke is still a hit.

289
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:20,510
Listen,

290
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,349
getting laid off

291
00:17:22,550 --> 00:17:23,680
was not only

292
00:17:24,069 --> 00:17:25,470
a turning point in my life

293
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:28,500
but also the starting point of my career.

294
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:29,480
My wife

295
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,150
used to scold me every day

296
00:17:32,210 --> 00:17:33,640
for making too little money

297
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:34,550
and worry

298
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:36,030
about accidents.

299
00:17:37,030 --> 00:17:37,550
And now?

300
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:39,960
I am...

301
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,270
the breadwinner.

302
00:17:43,270 --> 00:17:45,470
My wife listens to me about everything.

303
00:17:45,850 --> 00:17:47,000
Why are you laughing?

304
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:48,260
I'm telling the truth!

305
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,480
You know what?

306
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:50,720
At the family level,

307
00:17:50,930 --> 00:17:51,920
it has kept my household

308
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:53,050
in peace and harmony

309
00:17:54,310 --> 00:17:56,170
and improved our quality of life.

310
00:17:56,270 --> 00:17:57,440
In the bigger picture,

311
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:59,370
the country didn't lose

312
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:00,830
a business genius like me!

313
00:18:00,830 --> 00:18:01,640
What do you call this?

314
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:03,110
What? Huh?

315
00:18:04,510 --> 00:18:06,350
It's a win-win. The best of both worlds.

316
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:06,750
What?

317
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,680
Here are your noodles with beef.

318
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:11,550
Okay.

319
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,080
Thank you.

320
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:16,130
I'm leaving.

321
00:18:23,510 --> 00:18:24,070
Cheers.

322
00:18:48,550 --> 00:18:50,350
Why didn't you buy pig trotters?

323
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:52,160
Dad loved them the most.

324
00:18:53,110 --> 00:18:55,400
I'll go to the supermarket
and buy some later.

325
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,660
Don't buy them for him.

326
00:18:58,750 --> 00:19:00,280
Let him reflect on himself.

327
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:02,790
What nonsense are you talking about?

328
00:19:02,790 --> 00:19:04,050
I know the whole story.

329
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:10,340
Dad told me on his deathbed.

330
00:19:13,030 --> 00:19:14,160
He forced you

331
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,360
to marry me back then,

332
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:17,240
so he would agree to sign the letter

333
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,700
of forgiveness for Qi Zhi.

334
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:29,110
Just this?

335
00:19:31,510 --> 00:19:32,240
Just this.

336
00:19:35,810 --> 00:19:36,800
Is this

337
00:19:36,830 --> 00:19:38,030
a small matter to you?

338
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:41,960
All these years, I thought

339
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:43,200
you married me

340
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:45,400
because you loved me.

341
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:48,680
Xuanyu.

342
00:19:58,110 --> 00:19:58,960
I've seen

343
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:02,310
and remembered

344
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:04,280
how you've

345
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:07,120
treated me and Doudou

346
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:09,240
all these years.

347
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,570
You truly care about us.

348
00:20:19,790 --> 00:20:20,850
Do you hate me then?

349
00:20:25,150 --> 00:20:25,720
I did.

350
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:33,510
But now,

351
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:36,080
I just want to live a good life

352
00:20:36,590 --> 00:20:37,880
with you and Doudou.

353
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:51,790
Si,

354
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:54,960
I made you suffer.

355
00:20:57,030 --> 00:20:58,030
On behalf of my dad

356
00:20:58,790 --> 00:20:59,650
and the Zhous,

357
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:01,340
I sincerely apologize to you.

358
00:21:02,850 --> 00:21:03,640
In the future, I will

359
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,900
cherish you even more,

360
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:06,100
treat you well,

361
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:07,780
and never fail you.

362
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:18,310
Daddy, Mommy, I want a hug, too.

363
00:21:19,820 --> 00:21:21,550
Come here. Let me give you a hug.

364
00:21:23,590 --> 00:21:25,250
Let Daddy hold you in his arms.

365
00:21:25,310 --> 00:21:25,720
Daddy,

366
00:21:25,790 --> 00:21:27,480
they said it's New Year's Day tomorrow.

367
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:29,110
What are we eating?

368
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:31,450
What do you want to eat, Doudou?

369
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,270
Mommy will make

370
00:21:32,270 --> 00:21:33,510
whatever you want, okay?

371
00:21:33,510 --> 00:21:33,960
Okay.

372
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:35,070
What do you want to eat?

373
00:21:35,070 --> 00:21:35,880
Pig trotters.

374
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:37,480
Okay.

375
00:21:37,570 --> 00:21:39,270
We'll go buy some pig trotters then.

376
00:21:39,270 --> 00:21:39,800
Let's go.

377
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:47,770
Grandpa.

378
00:21:50,070 --> 00:21:50,440
Look,

379
00:21:50,830 --> 00:21:52,490
I got you a copy of the "I Ching"

380
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:53,880
from a street stall.

381
00:21:54,550 --> 00:21:54,880
Take a look.

382
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,400
Let me see. Let me check it out.

383
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:58,310
Alright, alright,
your hands are not clean.

384
00:21:58,310 --> 00:21:59,590
The book isn't going anywhere.

385
00:21:59,590 --> 00:22:00,160
I'll put it here.

386
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:00,960
Okay, okay.

387
00:22:01,110 --> 00:22:02,790
Your grandpa is just impatient.

388
00:22:02,790 --> 00:22:03,650
Thank you, Xin.

389
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:06,040
I brought you a foot bathtub.

390
00:22:06,290 --> 00:22:06,960
Your legs aren't great,

391
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:08,220
so soak your feet more.

392
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,410
It even has a massage function.

393
00:22:11,480 --> 00:22:13,810
Cao Xin has grown up.
He's caring about us.

394
00:22:15,510 --> 00:22:16,070
Cao Xin,

395
00:22:16,230 --> 00:22:18,270
how's your grad school application

396
00:22:18,270 --> 00:22:18,890
going?

397
00:22:19,110 --> 00:22:20,680
I've submitted the materials.

398
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:23,610
The results should be out
after the Spring Festival.

399
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:24,730
Grandpa!

400
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:27,920
I've told you so many times
that it's unhygienic!

401
00:22:27,920 --> 00:22:28,380
Well...

402
00:22:29,310 --> 00:22:30,590
It's a custom.

403
00:22:30,710 --> 00:22:31,530
Stop it. Stop.

404
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,410
Okay, I'm not putting it in.

405
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:34,900
Cao Xin,

406
00:22:35,800 --> 00:22:36,590
living abroad

407
00:22:36,590 --> 00:22:37,390
is expensive.

408
00:22:37,830 --> 00:22:39,400
But don't worry about money.

409
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,830
I'll bankroll you all the way.

410
00:22:40,830 --> 00:22:41,560
No need, Dad.

411
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,030
I've applied

412
00:22:43,030 --> 00:22:44,360
for a full scholarship.

413
00:22:44,400 --> 00:22:46,060
It won't be a problem, I think.

414
00:22:46,830 --> 00:22:47,960
Awesome, Cao Xin!

415
00:22:48,830 --> 00:22:50,030
Great.

416
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:53,060
I'll go check if the water is boiling.

417
00:22:56,030 --> 00:22:56,490
Come on.

418
00:22:57,550 --> 00:22:57,920
Okay.

419
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:01,260
By the way, Dad,

420
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:03,700
how come you're not on duty this year?

421
00:23:04,250 --> 00:23:05,560
Weren't you always

422
00:23:05,590 --> 00:23:06,720
so selfless before,

423
00:23:07,270 --> 00:23:08,880
letting others go home first
for New Year's Eve

424
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:11,010
and staying on duty until the very end?

425
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:14,680
Quite a lot of young people

426
00:23:14,680 --> 00:23:16,340
joined the company this year.

427
00:23:16,590 --> 00:23:18,110
They looked out for us veterans and let us

428
00:23:18,110 --> 00:23:19,350
come home for New Year's Eve.

429
00:23:19,350 --> 00:23:20,810
Look at you, a veteran now.

430
00:23:22,490 --> 00:23:23,920
You've devoted your whole life
to the mine.

431
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:25,350
Finally, someone is taking over.

432
00:23:25,350 --> 00:23:26,240
Exactly.

433
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:28,130
You've grown up,

434
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,530
and I'm getting old.

435
00:23:31,400 --> 00:23:32,070
Happy New Year.

436
00:23:32,070 --> 00:23:33,070
Happy New Year.

437
00:23:33,270 --> 00:23:34,200
Happy New Year, Cao Xin.

438
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:34,680
Happy New Year, Dad.

439
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:35,120
Xin.

440
00:23:41,750 --> 00:23:42,350
Dongfang,

441
00:23:43,030 --> 00:23:43,890
I feel like

442
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:45,240
nowadays,

443
00:23:46,110 --> 00:23:48,170
except for the Spring Festival Gala,

444
00:23:48,510 --> 00:23:50,310
the New Year vibe is almost gone.

445
00:23:50,510 --> 00:23:52,680
I remember when Xin was little,

446
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:54,010
right around this time,

447
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:56,200
firecrackers would be going off outside.

448
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:56,590
Well,

449
00:23:56,830 --> 00:23:57,830
it was so loud

450
00:23:58,030 --> 00:23:59,680
that we had to shout to hear
each other in the house.

451
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,610
Do you remember?

452
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:03,080
I remember one year

453
00:24:03,110 --> 00:24:05,440
when we celebrated the New Year
with the Qi family,

454
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:07,160
Qi Zhi grabbed a handful of flour

455
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:09,690
and sprinkled it
all over your sister's head.

456
00:24:09,830 --> 00:24:11,000
Aihua saw it

457
00:24:11,030 --> 00:24:12,560
and gave him a good beating.

458
00:24:16,070 --> 00:24:17,310
I really wish the kids

459
00:24:17,790 --> 00:24:20,050
could go back to the way
things used to be.

460
00:24:22,590 --> 00:24:23,650
What's wrong, Dad?

461
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:24,650
You got the coin?

462
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:27,270
Nice.

463
00:24:28,070 --> 00:24:29,210
It's a good omen

464
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:31,240
of wealth and good luck.

465
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:32,350
Grandpa.

466
00:24:32,750 --> 00:24:33,070
Xin,

467
00:24:33,270 --> 00:24:35,310
this is a sign that our family will have

468
00:24:35,310 --> 00:24:36,440
a smooth year ahead.

469
00:24:36,550 --> 00:24:37,810
Did it hurt your teeth?

470
00:24:38,070 --> 00:24:38,800
Are you okay?

471
00:24:39,070 --> 00:24:39,600
I'm fine.

472
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:41,720
Didn't Cao Xin tell you

473
00:24:41,750 --> 00:24:42,680
not to put it in?

474
00:24:42,750 --> 00:24:43,960
But you still put this coin.

475
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:44,920
Fine, fine. I won't do it again.

476
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:45,680
Keep it in mind.

477
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:46,160
Okay.

478
00:24:47,110 --> 00:24:47,970
By the way, Dad,

479
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:50,950
Qi Shi didn't come back this year again?

480
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:54,440
No.

481
00:25:01,110 --> 00:25:01,840
Cheers, Dad.

482
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,340
Happy New Year.

483
00:25:44,880 --> 00:25:45,440
Qi,

484
00:25:45,490 --> 00:25:47,080
you still opened your stall
on New Year's Eve?

485
00:25:47,080 --> 00:25:49,080
I just tried to make some more bucks.

486
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:13,030
Sweetie,

487
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:15,270
your mom got you some food
for New Year's Eve.

488
00:26:15,270 --> 00:26:16,800
And I got you a red envelope.

489
00:26:17,510 --> 00:26:19,200
Remember to buy handmade dumplings.

490
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:20,800
Don't eat those frozen ones.

491
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:24,860
Even if you're alone, you should
celebrate the New Year properly.

492
00:26:37,280 --> 00:26:38,550
Eat the dumplings while they're hot.

493
00:26:38,550 --> 00:26:39,680
Just eat your food.

494
00:26:42,270 --> 00:26:43,930
How is it? Is the filling good?

495
00:26:44,510 --> 00:26:44,970
So good.

496
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:49,030
Why did you

497
00:26:49,030 --> 00:26:49,960
bring out the leftovers

498
00:26:49,960 --> 00:26:51,020
for New Year's Eve?

499
00:26:51,220 --> 00:26:52,950
If you're not eating it, I will.

500
00:26:57,840 --> 00:26:59,430
It'd be so nice to celebrate at home,

501
00:26:59,430 --> 00:27:01,290
but you insisted on staying here.

502
00:27:01,550 --> 00:27:02,550
Just look around the market.

503
00:27:02,550 --> 00:27:03,880
How many shops are open?

504
00:27:07,290 --> 00:27:08,160
There are few shops open,

505
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,350
so we can make money.

506
00:27:10,200 --> 00:27:11,860
Right? During New Year's Eve,

507
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:14,920
everyone visits their relatives

508
00:27:15,270 --> 00:27:16,600
and host some banquets,

509
00:27:16,750 --> 00:27:18,210
so they have to buy things.

510
00:27:19,110 --> 00:27:19,550
Someone

511
00:27:19,550 --> 00:27:21,410
just bought a pack of salt, right?

512
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:23,110
Every penny counts.

513
00:27:23,310 --> 00:27:23,920
You think money

514
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:25,030
grows on trees?

515
00:27:33,350 --> 00:27:34,200
Bring it to me.

516
00:27:38,830 --> 00:27:39,900
Look for yourself.

517
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:41,590
You look.

518
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:48,790
It's a text from our daughter,

519
00:27:49,940 --> 00:27:51,850
thanking us

520
00:27:51,880 --> 00:27:53,540
for the New Year's Eve dinner.

521
00:27:54,590 --> 00:27:56,310
She bought and cooked dumplings

522
00:27:56,310 --> 00:27:57,240
on her own.

523
00:27:58,590 --> 00:27:59,270
We shouldn't have spoiled her

524
00:27:59,270 --> 00:28:00,440
when she was little.

525
00:28:01,070 --> 00:28:02,200
Look at her now.

526
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:03,460
She can't do anything.

527
00:28:03,750 --> 00:28:05,550
She even had to buy dumplings.

528
00:28:06,110 --> 00:28:06,880
With skills like that,

529
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:08,790
why is she still working out there?

530
00:28:08,790 --> 00:28:09,990
She should just quit.

531
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:11,200
Honey,

532
00:28:12,740 --> 00:28:13,790
the dumplings you make

533
00:28:13,790 --> 00:28:15,480
are the best in the world.

534
00:28:15,670 --> 00:28:16,330
Seriously.

535
00:28:17,270 --> 00:28:19,060
When Sweetie comes back,

536
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,830
you have to teach her step by step.

537
00:28:20,830 --> 00:28:22,290
This recipe can't be lost.

538
00:28:25,330 --> 00:28:26,640
I wonder whether Qi Zhi has dumplings

539
00:28:26,640 --> 00:28:27,750
to eat in there.

540
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,370
Don't worry.

541
00:28:31,750 --> 00:28:32,680
I asked about it.

542
00:28:34,790 --> 00:28:36,990
Inmates celebrate New Year's Eve, too.

543
00:28:39,790 --> 00:28:41,450
They have all the usual stuff.

544
00:28:45,750 --> 00:28:46,350
This is it.

545
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:47,330
What?

546
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:50,180
Why did you take such an expensive one?

547
00:28:50,180 --> 00:28:52,140
Let's have some good liquor
for New Year's Eve.

548
00:28:52,140 --> 00:28:52,760
Alright?

549
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:54,130
Have a drink with me?

550
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:55,240
Come on.

551
00:29:00,510 --> 00:29:01,370
This is enough.

552
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,030
Okay.

553
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:06,460
Come on.

554
00:29:07,680 --> 00:29:08,540
Happy New Year.

555
00:29:50,750 --> 00:29:51,640
Hello.

556
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:52,790
Where are you going?

557
00:29:52,790 --> 00:29:53,440
To class.

558
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:55,120
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

559
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:02,920
Hello.

560
00:30:03,440 --> 00:30:04,240
Where are you going?

561
00:30:04,240 --> 00:30:04,830
To class.

562
00:30:04,920 --> 00:30:06,120
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

563
00:30:11,750 --> 00:30:12,480
The water

564
00:30:12,480 --> 00:30:14,830
in our school's boiler room
isn't hot at all.

565
00:30:14,830 --> 00:30:16,000
I was hoping

566
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:17,070
I could soak my feet

567
00:30:17,270 --> 00:30:18,470
every day like my dad.

568
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:19,880
Guess I can't do that.

569
00:30:43,550 --> 00:30:44,030
Hey,

570
00:30:44,750 --> 00:30:45,270
wait a minute.

571
00:30:45,270 --> 00:30:46,600
What are you doing here?

572
00:30:46,830 --> 00:30:48,290
I'm going back to the dorm.

573
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:49,310
Which dorm?

574
00:30:53,310 --> 00:30:54,880
I'm here to meet my friends

575
00:30:54,900 --> 00:30:56,200
and drop off some stuff.

576
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:56,720
Sign in.

577
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:07,840
Zhang Li, come give me a hand.

578
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:08,750
There's so much stuff.

579
00:31:08,750 --> 00:31:09,240
Boss Qi.

580
00:31:09,270 --> 00:31:10,030
Boss Qi, long time no see.

581
00:31:10,030 --> 00:31:11,000
Welcome, Boss Qi.

582
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:12,030
You brought quite a lot.

583
00:31:12,030 --> 00:31:13,180
All new arrivals.

584
00:31:14,070 --> 00:31:14,760
I've got

585
00:31:14,790 --> 00:31:16,110
these clothes in your sizes.

586
00:31:16,110 --> 00:31:16,550
Okay, nice.

587
00:31:16,550 --> 00:31:17,160
Qi Shi.

588
00:31:17,510 --> 00:31:18,160
Did you bring

589
00:31:18,160 --> 00:31:19,160
that interview suit

590
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:19,830
I mentioned before?

591
00:31:19,830 --> 00:31:20,240
Yes.

592
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:21,550
The interview is in a few days.

593
00:31:21,550 --> 00:31:23,210
It's a make-or-break moment.

594
00:31:23,550 --> 00:31:24,150
This is it.

595
00:31:24,610 --> 00:31:26,400
I also matched it
with a pair of shoes for you.

596
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:27,000
So pretty.

597
00:31:27,030 --> 00:31:27,400
Okay.

598
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:29,240
Look.

599
00:31:29,960 --> 00:31:30,720
I passed by your stall

600
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:31,400
when I went shopping.

601
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:32,640
What clothes did you bring today?

602
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:33,700
Many new arrivals!

603
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:35,620
Feel free to look and pick.

604
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:37,580
This suits you.

605
00:31:38,310 --> 00:31:39,160
I also think so.

606
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:39,680
How is it?

607
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:40,510
Do I look mature

608
00:31:40,510 --> 00:31:41,240
in this suit?

609
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:42,750
-It looks good!
-Not bad!

610
00:31:42,750 --> 00:31:43,720
I'm just worried

611
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:44,510
the interviewer will

612
00:31:44,510 --> 00:31:46,350
think I look like a kid
when I interview in a few days.

613
00:31:46,350 --> 00:31:47,350
By the way, Qi Shi.

614
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:48,830
Are there any shoes

615
00:31:48,850 --> 00:31:49,680
that come with heels?

616
00:31:49,680 --> 00:31:50,920
I want to look a bit more mature.

617
00:31:50,920 --> 00:31:52,350
Why do you need to look mature?

618
00:31:52,350 --> 00:31:53,680
The resume you handed in

619
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:55,450
says you're a college student.

620
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:57,720
How great it is to be a college student.

621
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:59,720
Young, confident, and passionate.

622
00:31:59,790 --> 00:32:00,880
These are your advantages.

623
00:32:00,880 --> 00:32:02,590
You need to maximize your advantages.

624
00:32:02,590 --> 00:32:03,750
How embarrassing it would be

625
00:32:03,750 --> 00:32:04,960
if you can't walk properly in high heels

626
00:32:04,960 --> 00:32:06,290
and end up falling over!

627
00:32:06,550 --> 00:32:07,550
That's true.

628
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:09,720
You're indeed more sophisticated.

629
00:32:10,070 --> 00:32:11,320
I also made a catalog.

630
00:32:11,350 --> 00:32:11,790
Look,

631
00:32:12,110 --> 00:32:13,740
these are the outfits I put together

632
00:32:13,740 --> 00:32:14,680
for you to pick.

633
00:32:14,830 --> 00:32:16,270
You can check off the ones you like,

634
00:32:16,270 --> 00:32:17,350
and I'll bring them to you next time.

635
00:32:17,350 --> 00:32:17,920
-Okay.
-Great.

636
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:18,350
Okay.

637
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:19,350
Let me see.

638
00:32:22,590 --> 00:32:23,350
Boss Qi,

639
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:25,000
aren't you planning to open a store?

640
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,270
It'll be easier for us to find you then.

641
00:32:26,270 --> 00:32:27,870
-Indeed!
-Exactly, Boss Qi.

642
00:32:28,480 --> 00:32:30,310
My dear fairies
who don't know the struggles

643
00:32:30,310 --> 00:32:31,310
of the real world,

644
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:33,030
opening a store isn't that easy.

645
00:32:33,030 --> 00:32:34,350
You can't just say it and have it.

646
00:32:34,350 --> 00:32:35,790
Money! It costs money!

647
00:32:37,030 --> 00:32:37,480
But

648
00:32:38,270 --> 00:32:39,270
if you buy

649
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:40,740
more clothes today,

650
00:32:40,740 --> 00:32:42,160
you'll be helping pave the way

651
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:43,110
for my future store.

652
00:32:43,110 --> 00:32:45,170
-No problem.
-No problem. We'll buy.

653
00:32:45,480 --> 00:32:46,280
Here's water.

654
00:32:46,400 --> 00:32:47,460
Check out this one.

655
00:32:47,960 --> 00:32:49,070
Look at this outfit.

656
00:32:49,070 --> 00:32:50,260
You really brought

657
00:32:50,680 --> 00:32:51,590
planty of bags.

658
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:54,140
They're really heavy.

659
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:02,490
Graduate entrance exam materials?

660
00:33:02,490 --> 00:33:04,020
Marketing...

661
00:33:05,200 --> 00:33:06,200
Marketing...

662
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:13,730
Your schedule is so packed.

663
00:33:14,110 --> 00:33:15,160
I just wrote them down randomly.

664
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:16,440
I might not do all of them.

665
00:33:16,440 --> 00:33:17,170
I got this hat

666
00:33:17,210 --> 00:33:18,350
from you.

667
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:28,600
Oh, right,

668
00:33:29,400 --> 00:33:31,550
how's your graduate entrance exam going?

669
00:33:31,550 --> 00:33:33,110
Didn't you get through the second round?

670
00:33:33,110 --> 00:33:34,750
I've even kept an outfit for you

671
00:33:34,750 --> 00:33:36,150
to wear to the interview.

672
00:33:37,350 --> 00:33:39,350
I'm waiting to hear from the school.

673
00:33:39,510 --> 00:33:41,680
I'm not really confident about it.

674
00:33:43,030 --> 00:33:44,720
Worst case, I'll just go find a job.

675
00:33:44,720 --> 00:33:45,450
Don't worry.

676
00:33:46,070 --> 00:33:47,930
You're a proper college student.

677
00:33:48,030 --> 00:33:48,810
Look at me,

678
00:33:49,270 --> 00:33:50,330
a high school grad,

679
00:33:50,350 --> 00:33:51,480
taking night classes.

680
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:53,240
And I'm still doing just fine, huh?

681
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:54,440
To be honest with you,

682
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:55,480
I was a bit nervous

683
00:33:55,790 --> 00:33:57,270
when I first walked in here.

684
00:33:57,270 --> 00:33:58,310
Nervous about what?

685
00:33:58,310 --> 00:33:59,200
College!

686
00:34:00,030 --> 00:34:01,070
This is a college!

687
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,260
But thinking about it,

688
00:34:03,590 --> 00:34:04,830
I guess I'm doing something

689
00:34:04,830 --> 00:34:05,920
for you college students.

690
00:34:05,920 --> 00:34:06,520
Of course!

691
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,330
Degrees aren't important.

692
00:34:08,330 --> 00:34:09,440
Living your own wonderful life

693
00:34:09,440 --> 00:34:10,370
is what matters.

694
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:11,840
Look at Tian Zihao.

695
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:12,840
He retook the exam for 3 years

696
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,550
just to enroll at our junior college.

697
00:34:14,550 --> 00:34:15,880
He finally fulfilled his mother's

698
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:16,810
long-held wish.

699
00:34:18,070 --> 00:34:19,130
They held banquets

700
00:34:19,190 --> 00:34:21,000
for 3 whole days.

701
00:34:22,440 --> 00:34:23,590
Oh, right, and Cao Xin.

702
00:34:23,590 --> 00:34:25,719
I've heard he's planning to go abroad.

703
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:29,480
Qi Shi,

704
00:34:29,710 --> 00:34:30,570
I want this one.

705
00:34:31,070 --> 00:34:31,550
Qi Shi,

706
00:34:31,590 --> 00:34:32,600
do you have this in a medium?

707
00:34:32,600 --> 00:34:33,920
Qi Shi, do you have any scarves for me

708
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:34,320
to match it?

709
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:34,760
I'll write it down.

710
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:35,960
One at a time, please.

711
00:34:36,480 --> 00:34:37,840
Dad, eat slowly.

712
00:34:38,440 --> 00:34:40,300
Your lunch break is way too short.

713
00:34:42,510 --> 00:34:42,880
Dad,

714
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:45,350
you're either staying up late

715
00:34:45,480 --> 00:34:46,630
or skipping meals.

716
00:34:47,150 --> 00:34:48,710
You've never suffered like this before.

717
00:34:48,710 --> 00:34:49,480
Keeping this up will

718
00:34:49,480 --> 00:34:50,840
take a toll on your health.

719
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:51,440
It's fine.

720
00:34:52,590 --> 00:34:53,840
Let's talk about it when it really

721
00:34:53,840 --> 00:34:54,370
happens.

722
00:34:55,230 --> 00:34:57,230
It's so hard to find a job these days,

723
00:34:57,510 --> 00:34:58,920
especially at my age.

724
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:00,800
It took

725
00:35:01,200 --> 00:35:02,590
a lot of effort just to get

726
00:35:02,590 --> 00:35:03,190
this one.

727
00:35:03,980 --> 00:35:05,380
Making money is hard now.

728
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,800
I'll earn whatever I can.

729
00:35:07,230 --> 00:35:07,760
Although

730
00:35:07,950 --> 00:35:08,920
we still have some savings

731
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:09,670
in the bank,

732
00:35:10,030 --> 00:35:10,960
but your brother

733
00:35:11,290 --> 00:35:11,840
is going to

734
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:13,300
study abroad soon, right?

735
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:14,590
When he's alone out there,

736
00:35:14,590 --> 00:35:16,320
money will be his only backing.

737
00:35:17,880 --> 00:35:18,190
Dad,

738
00:35:18,550 --> 00:35:20,360
I still have tens of thousands saved up.

739
00:35:20,360 --> 00:35:21,420
If it's not enough,

740
00:35:21,480 --> 00:35:23,410
I can also borrow some from Xuanyu.

741
00:35:23,980 --> 00:35:24,730
How can I use

742
00:35:24,760 --> 00:35:25,510
your money?

743
00:35:26,700 --> 00:35:27,560
And don't tell Xuanyu

744
00:35:27,560 --> 00:35:28,330
about this.

745
00:35:29,110 --> 00:35:30,840
I just want you two to live well.

746
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,120
Don't worry about me.

747
00:35:34,590 --> 00:35:35,390
You may go now.

748
00:35:37,110 --> 00:35:38,360
Don't interrupt my work.

749
00:35:38,360 --> 00:35:38,960
Off you go.

750
00:35:39,230 --> 00:35:40,070
Take your time eating.

751
00:35:40,070 --> 00:35:40,660
I know.

752
00:35:50,510 --> 00:35:51,800
Hello, welcome.

753
00:35:56,670 --> 00:35:58,030
Look who it is.

754
00:36:00,280 --> 00:36:01,630
Isn't this

755
00:36:01,630 --> 00:36:02,890
our upright Chief Cao?

756
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,800
Why are you standing guard here?

757
00:36:07,280 --> 00:36:08,010
Oh, I forgot.

758
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,930
You took early retirement.

759
00:36:11,710 --> 00:36:13,170
Looking at the way you are,

760
00:36:13,320 --> 00:36:14,670
isn't it just like when we got laid off

761
00:36:14,670 --> 00:36:15,280
back then?

762
00:36:20,070 --> 00:36:21,190
This way, please.

763
00:36:22,230 --> 00:36:23,410
Mr. Zhang, welcome.

764
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:24,400
You may go

765
00:36:24,400 --> 00:36:25,860
to Mr. Jin's office first.

766
00:36:26,150 --> 00:36:27,550
I'll park the car for you.

767
00:36:30,280 --> 00:36:30,800
You guys are

768
00:36:30,800 --> 00:36:32,000
getting ridiculous.

769
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:34,400
You're running such a big bathhouse,

770
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:36,440
and you hire an old man to guard the door?

771
00:36:36,440 --> 00:36:37,770
Can he really handle it?

772
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:42,000
Cao is pretty dedicated and responsible.

773
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:43,000
He does a good job.

774
00:36:49,800 --> 00:36:51,030
My shoes are dirty.

775
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:52,440
Chief Cao,

776
00:36:53,590 --> 00:36:55,050
could you wipe them for me?

777
00:36:58,550 --> 00:36:59,100
Zhou,

778
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:00,400
bring a rag out

779
00:37:00,550 --> 00:37:01,850
to wipe Mr. Zhang's shoes.

780
00:37:01,850 --> 00:37:03,210
I want Chief Cao to do it.

781
00:37:08,860 --> 00:37:10,570
When did you offend Mr. Zhang?

782
00:37:11,670 --> 00:37:12,800
He's in the foreign trade

783
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:14,130
clothing business now.

784
00:37:15,200 --> 00:37:16,550
Our boss, Mr. Jin, wants him to invest

785
00:37:16,550 --> 00:37:17,830
in the bathhouse!

786
00:37:18,590 --> 00:37:20,250
We can't afford to offend him.

787
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:38,860
What's that smell?

788
00:37:39,550 --> 00:37:40,880
This cloth smells sour.

789
00:37:57,480 --> 00:37:59,140
You guys probably don't know.

790
00:37:59,440 --> 00:38:00,480
Chief Cao

791
00:38:00,670 --> 00:38:01,960
used to be my boss.

792
00:38:03,070 --> 00:38:03,880
Back then, I was

793
00:38:03,880 --> 00:38:05,590
laid off from Qingwu No. 3 Mine,

794
00:38:05,590 --> 00:38:07,030
all thanks to him.

795
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:08,360
Never thought

796
00:38:08,360 --> 00:38:09,760
that after so many years,

797
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:11,030
our Chief Cao

798
00:38:11,230 --> 00:38:13,070
would still be so dedicated to his work

799
00:38:13,070 --> 00:38:14,000
and meticulous.

800
00:38:18,590 --> 00:38:19,120
This way.

801
00:38:53,480 --> 00:39:16,770
[Only for the drama.
Please do not imitate]

802
00:39:37,400 --> 00:39:38,320
Darn it.

803
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:48,040
Who the heck did this?

804
00:39:48,550 --> 00:39:49,770
Who stuffed the thing in here?

805
00:39:49,770 --> 00:39:50,760
You have really good taste.

806
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:52,630
This is a new arrival.
The fabric is great.

807
00:39:52,630 --> 00:39:53,800
It's also good for summer.

808
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:54,800
It's 45 yuan, but I'll do 40 for you.

809
00:39:54,800 --> 00:39:55,190
Okay.

810
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,230
Here, 40.

811
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:00,150
Here you are.

812
00:40:00,400 --> 00:40:00,880
Thank you.

813
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:01,540
No problem.

814
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:02,400
Busy?

815
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:03,880
Checking up on me again?

816
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:06,190
I'm doing it legally now.
I have a license.

817
00:40:06,190 --> 00:40:07,320
Stop joking around.

818
00:40:07,510 --> 00:40:08,910
It's something serious.

819
00:40:09,040 --> 00:40:09,670
Didn't you ask me

820
00:40:09,670 --> 00:40:10,930
to help you find a shop?

821
00:40:11,440 --> 00:40:12,170
It so happens

822
00:40:12,630 --> 00:40:14,670
that there's a shop
on the commercial street of Wulin Road

823
00:40:14,670 --> 00:40:16,270
looking to sublet urgently.

824
00:40:16,390 --> 00:40:17,720
I checked it out for you.

825
00:40:18,190 --> 00:40:19,230
There's quite a lot

826
00:40:19,230 --> 00:40:20,510
of foot traffic there.

827
00:40:21,110 --> 00:40:22,280
The shop isn't very big.

828
00:40:22,280 --> 00:40:24,110
I think the rent won't be expensive.

829
00:40:24,110 --> 00:40:25,550
You can probably afford it.

830
00:40:25,550 --> 00:40:26,630
If you're interested,

831
00:40:26,630 --> 00:40:28,430
go take a look in your spare time.

832
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,800
Nice. Thanks, bro.

833
00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:32,230
I'll go tomorrow.

834
00:40:32,230 --> 00:40:33,800
I can learn a thing or two as well.

835
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:34,130
Okay.

836
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:36,080
Bye. You can get back to work.

837
00:40:36,550 --> 00:40:39,000
You're not bringing some clothes
back for your wife?

838
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:39,600
Next time.

839
00:40:40,110 --> 00:40:42,310
He's not supporting my business at all.

840
00:41:17,200 --> 00:41:24,570
[Shop for Sublease] [Big Sale!]

841
00:41:29,590 --> 00:41:32,970
[Rent: 60,000 yuan per year]

842
00:42:17,920 --> 00:42:18,380
Cao Xin!

843
00:42:20,030 --> 00:42:20,890
I've heard that

844
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:23,010
you got accepted to Macdonald,

845
00:42:23,230 --> 00:42:24,630
with a full scholarship.

846
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:26,550
It seems only two people
from our school got it—

847
00:42:26,550 --> 00:42:27,880
you and Gu Qingcheng.

848
00:42:28,590 --> 00:42:30,520
You're really something, Cao Xin.

849
00:42:30,880 --> 00:42:32,030
We're just study buddies

850
00:42:32,030 --> 00:42:33,030
in the same group.

851
00:42:33,360 --> 00:42:34,190
Come on!

852
00:42:34,800 --> 00:42:36,200
Gu Qingcheng is into you.

853
00:42:36,510 --> 00:42:38,170
Anyone with eyes can see that.

854
00:42:38,630 --> 00:42:39,430
Only you would

855
00:42:39,930 --> 00:42:40,440
string her along,

856
00:42:40,440 --> 00:42:41,480
calling yourselves

857
00:42:41,480 --> 00:42:42,480
"study buddies."

858
00:42:43,840 --> 00:42:44,520
Stop it.

859
00:42:44,880 --> 00:42:46,410
Don't make me sound so shallow.

860
00:42:46,410 --> 00:42:47,440
And don't make Gu Qingcheng sound

861
00:42:47,440 --> 00:42:48,370
shallow either.

862
00:42:48,630 --> 00:42:49,290
Alright...

863
00:42:49,670 --> 00:42:51,550
I don't understand you top students.

864
00:42:51,550 --> 00:42:53,630
But it's said that
even with a full scholarship,

865
00:42:53,630 --> 00:42:55,160
studying in the US will cost

866
00:42:55,290 --> 00:42:56,070
over 100,000 yuan a year

867
00:42:56,070 --> 00:42:57,130
in other expenses.

868
00:42:57,450 --> 00:42:58,800
Are you sure this is a school

869
00:42:58,800 --> 00:43:00,530
we ordinary people can afford?

